    "rich_text_6aeaLY": {
      "type": "rich_text",
      "name": "Rich Text",
      "settings": {
        "richtext_inhalt": "<p><strong>AVAILABILITY AS A PROMISE</strong></p><p>In the key account business, the ability to deliver is not an option, but a fundamental requirement. If an IT manager rolls out 200 laptops and realises three days later that the cases are not available, this is not just a logistical problem – it undermines trust in the entire supply chain. DICOTA keeps its 50 top-selling products permanently in stock and guarantees short delivery times, even for larger quantities.<br/>For retailers, this means they can make binding commitments to their major clients – and actually keep them. That is the difference between a supplier and a partner.</p><p><strong><br/>PLANNABILITY THROUGH FRAMEWORK AGREEMENTS</strong></p><p>Major customers think in terms of budget cycles, not individual orders. Framework agreements with defined products, prices and call-off quantities are the norm in the enterprise sector. DICOTA fully supports this model: retailers can enter into framework agreements that offer their customers predictable terms and conditions and provide the retailers themselves with predictable margins.<br/>Typical contract terms of 12 to 36 months provide certainty for both parties. At the same time, call-off quantities can be managed flexibly – ideal for customers with seasonal fluctuations or rolling deployment cycles.<br/><br/><strong><br/>SIMPLE PROCESSING – NO ADMINISTRATIVE OVERHEAD</strong></p><p>Many retailers underestimate the amount of internal effort generated by an unstructured range of accessories: different suppliers, varying ordering processes, inconsistent documentation. DICOTA simplifies this radically. A small number of clearly defined SKUs, a straightforward price list and a well-established ordering process reduce the administrative burden to a minimum.</p>",
        "width": "narrow",
        "padding_top": 4,
        "padding_bottom": 4
      }
    },
    "value_tabs_8xDcCx": {
      "type": "value_tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_WtkFKC": {
          "type": "tab",
          "name": "More Margin",
          "settings": {
            "text_tab_label": "More Margin",
            "text_tab_heading": "Margin without extra effort",
            "textarea_tab_text": "The real margin potential in run-rate business does not lie in the top-seller itself – it lies in the attach. Every laptop sold is a gateway to several accessories that are regularly reordered. The trick lies in integrating these add-on products into the ordering process in such a way that they are automatically included – without having to be renegotiated each time."
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "tab_EnGYGA": {
          "type": "tab",
          "name": "Sleeves & Cases",
          "settings": {
            "text_tab_label": "Sleeves & Cases",
            "text_tab_heading": "Sleeves & Cases",
            "textarea_tab_text": "Precisely tailored to device size and brand – simply include them as standard items in your shopping basket. No explanation needed, no tender required. Sleeves and cases are a staple in virtually every corporate IT environment. If you include them as standard extras in your range, you’ll sell them without having to actively promote them."
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "tab_U46hmf": {
          "type": "tab",
          "name": "Locks & Security",
          "settings": {
            "text_tab_label": "Locks & Security",
            "text_tab_heading": "Locks & Security",
            "textarea_tab_text": "Anti-theft protection is an IT policy requirement in many companies – not an optional accessory. Locks are an essential item, particularly in environments with shared workstations, co-working spaces or field service teams. The advantage for retailers: high add-on rate, minimal need for explanation, good contribution margin."
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "tab_3n6qfQ": {
          "type": "tab",
          "name": "Adapters & Connectivity",
          "settings": {
            "text_tab_label": "Adapters & Connectivity",
            "text_tab_heading": "Adapters & Connectivity",
            "textarea_tab_text": "USB-C hubs, HDMI adaptors, multi-port solutions – these items are always in demand, but rarely ordered proactively. They often end up as emergency purchases in retail outlets or on online platforms when an employee realises during their first meeting whilst working from home that they don’t have the right connector. Stocking these items in your standard product range fills this gap – and noticeably increases the order value."
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "tab_meKBEP": {
          "type": "tab",
          "name": "Backpacks & Bags",
          "settings": {
            "text_tab_label": "Backpacks & Bags",
            "text_tab_heading": "Backpacks & Bags",
            "textarea_tab_text": "Corporate backpacks and business bags are standard items in tenders from major clients – particularly for field sales teams, consultants and hybrid workers. DICOTA offers a wide range across various price points that can be easily integrated into framework agreements."
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
